                </div>

                <div class="faq_items--answer">
                  <p>
                    In your next golf adventure, start a round in the Blue Tees Game app and get delivered a Post Round
                    Report. Get Tour-level insights and analysis of your game using the Post Game experience. See your
                    game in a visual way like never before with the 3D hole summary of your game. All you have to do is
                    shot track and keep score. Incredible insights are at your fingertips.
                  </p>
                </div>
