                      <path class="icon-path-2" d="M11.5156 21.5911V2.125" stroke="black"
                          stroke-width="2.43326" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="faq_items--answer">
                  <p>
                    The primary experience is using the app as a GPS unit first to provide the easiest way to see the
                    front/center/back yardage for every shot. What’s different is that this app is the one to use to
                    help you improve your game. With the easiest way to get one touch score and golf data into the app
                    you’ll be able to get insights into your game sent right to you when the round ends.
                  </p>
